 "what_was_replayed": "Each sampled session was extracted from its committed archive sessions/<session>.tar.xz (SHA-256 checked against runs/progress.jsonl) into a scratch directory, one at a time, and audited with `ecbench verify --dir <extracted> --replay-all`; the fallback `--replay 50` applies only if --replay-all exceeded 1800 s (field mode). The audit re-derives the session from its own files (file hashes, spec and plan identity, seeds, execution order, record seals and count), re-checks every recovered logarithm [k]G = Q on every record (warm-up included) and re-executes every measured deterministic run, requiring identical answer, total, phases, counters and factor base. The receipt's file map and session id were compared with the committed Phase B audit receipt (sessions/<session>.audit.json). The extracted copy was deleted after each session (free disk about 0.5 GB).",
